  "question": {
    "text": "The number of <math><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></math> matrices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> with real entries, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>I</mi></math>, is equal to"
  },
